## 6. Daily principles

- **Do:** 60–90 minutes real code/config on the repo (prefer over passive reading).
- **Learn:** only enough docs to finish today's task (just-in-time).
- **Own:** 1–3 bullets you could explain to someone else in 2 minutes.

